{"title":"1962 AHSME Problems/Problem 12","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>When <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/b/f4b40aa177b8e51ed7ce3f00a8a1c04b0d25cd51.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left(1 - \\frac{1}{a}\\right)^6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"80\" height=\"48\" /> is expanded, the sum of the last three coefficients is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/4/23419efcb03fd0162cd54b4f29c52ee964052d37.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 22 \\qquad  \\textbf{(B)}\\ 11 \\qquad  \\textbf{(C)}\\ 10 \\qquad  \\textbf{(D)}\\ -10 \\qquad  \\textbf{(E)}\\ -11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"438\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>This is equivalent to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/f/8bf95f348eebfc12dba4243be322feb8fa090fae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{(a-1)^6}{a^6}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"70\" height=\"39\" />\nIts expansion has 7 terms, whose coefficients are the same as those of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/b/9dba3b5133619e265e5f440fd82a670bf274ee53.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a-1)^6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"19\" />.\nBy the Binomial Theorem, the sum of the last three coefficients is \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/8/b88243b84cdf30e8064e655a3b8977ab69af4f54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\binom{6}{2}-\\binom{6}{1}+\\binom{6}{0}=15-6+1=\\boxed{10 \\textbf{ (C)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"350\" height=\"53\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME\" title=\"1962 AHSME\">1962 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1962 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1962 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1962\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>Problem 11</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1962 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1962 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1962 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1962 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_A